-- sign (1)
  [v11_double_slit_2d] the phase of the pattern's Fourier component at the fringe frequency {phi:+.4f} rad (0 for a symmetric pattern without flux) against the two-path model 2πΦ/Φ₀·sign(q) = {shift:+.4f} rad: the fringes move by Φ/Φ₀ of a period; the difference is taken modulo 2π (review B3-9)
