  [engine] Classical MD in 2-D and 3-D: particle species (mass, charge, σ, ε), molecules with bonds and angles, a short-range pair potential (from theories.models) by Verlet lists, the Coulomb interaction (a direct sum in a box with walls), walls (specular, thermal with diffuse re-emission — a heat bath, soft), a movable piston (mass, external pressure, work), a uniform field; velocity Verlet (NVE), the CSVR (Bussi–Donadio–Parrinello) and Langevin (BAOAB) thermostats, also in a region of space; changes at the current moment (transactional): among them the pair model, the time step, an axis periodic or with walls, many molecules in one edit, the box size (an affine deformation at once or over a given time in small steps, the work on the system accounted for exactly, to first order in the affine stress; or a wall shift); temperature, pressure from the virial and from the momentum given to the walls, energies, momentum, g(r), MSD, the velocity distribution, heat and work counters, the step error from a companion run with dt/2; the state is plain data, continued bit for bit.
